{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "title",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# Green Oak Control Board — Wiring (Rev A v1.0)\nสร้างจาก `hardware/kicad/output/GreenOak.net` ด้วย `tools/gen_wiring_canvas.py` — ตรงกับ Schematic/PCB เสมอ\n\nสี: 🟥 ไฟ 12V/กำลัง · 🟧 5V/3V3 · 🟦 Connector บน PCB · 🟪 อุปกรณ์นอกบอร์ด · 🟩 วงจรบนบอร์ด\nลูกศร = ทางเดินไฟ/สัญญาณ, ป้ายบนเส้น = Net หรือ GPIO",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -330,
			"width": 860,
			"height": 260
		},
		{
			"id": "g_pwr",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "POWER — 12V → ฟิวส์ → สวิตช์ → +12V / 5V / 3V3",
			"x": -1300,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 1100,
			"height": 1560,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "p_psu",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### PSU 12V ≥ 10 A\n(นอกบอร์ด)\nขาเข้า 220V ผ่าน CT ของ PZEM",
			"x": -1280,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "p_j1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### J1 12V IN (Terminal 5.08)\n| ขา | Net | ต่อกับ |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `+12V_IN` | +12V จาก PSU |\n| 2 | `GND` | GND จาก PSU |",
			"x": -980,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "p_f1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### F1 10A 5x20 glass\nฟิวส์รวม (คลิป 5×20)\n`+12V_IN` → `12V_FUSED`",
			"x": -580,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 330,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "p_j2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### J2 POWER SWITCH (Terminal, สวิตช์อยู่นอกบอร์ด)\n| ขา | Net | ต่อกับ |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `12V_FUSED` | ขาเข้าสวิตช์ |\n| 2 | `+12V` | ขาออกสวิตช์ = ราง +12V |",
			"x": -980,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 190,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "p_rail",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ราง +12V\nต่อกับ: C1.1, D2.1, D3.1, D4.1, D5.1, F2.1, F3.1, J2.2, J5.1, J6.1, J7.1, J8.1, TP1.1, U1.1\n\n- C1 470uF/25V กรองไฟ\n- TP1 = จุดวัด +12V",
			"x": -520,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 260,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "p_f2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### F2 5A 5x20 glass\n`+12V` → `+12V_LED`\nเลี้ยง Grow Light อย่างเดียว",
			"x": -980,
			"y": 520,
			"width": 330,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "p_f3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### F3 0.5A PTC 1812\n`+12V` → `+12V_SENSOR`\nกันสาย Sensor ลัดวงจร",
			"x": -580,
			"y": 580,
			"width": 330,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "p_j3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### J3 12V SENSOR (Terminal)\n| ขา | Net | ต่อกับ |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `+12V_SENSOR` | +12V ไป PAR / 5-in-1 / QDY30A (สายแดง) |\n| 2 | `GND` | GND ของ Sensor ทั้ง 3 |",
			"x": -580,
			"y": 760,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 190,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "p_buck",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### U1 CR-DC2580 12V->5V\n| ขา | Net |\n|---|---|\n| IN+ | `+12V` |\n| IN− | `GND` |\n| OUT+ | `+5V` |\n| OUT− | `GND` |\nC2 100uF/16V + C3 100nF ที่ +5V",
			"x": -1280,
			"y": 700,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "p_5v",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ราง +5V\nต่อกับ: C2.1, C3.1, D1.2, J12.1, J14.1, J15.1, JP1.1, TP2.1, U1.3\n\nใช้เลี้ยง: W5500, PZEM (ฝั่ง TTL), YF-S401, Relay (ถ้า JP1 = 5V)",
			"x": -1280,
			"y": 1040,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 260,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "p_d1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### D1 SK34SMA-3G\n`+5V` → `+5V_DEVKIT` → ขา **5V** ของ DevKit\nกันไฟจาก USB ย้อนเข้าราง 5V",
			"x": -900,
			"y": 1040,
			"width": 330,
			"height": 150,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "p_3v3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ราง +3V3 (จาก LDO ของ DevKit)\nต่อกับ: J11.1, J13.1, J16.2, J17.2, JP1.3, R19.1, R20.1, R21.1, TP3.1, U2.1, U2.2\n\nใช้เลี้ยง: RS485 module, SHT40, DS3231, Pull-up YF-S401, Spare",
			"x": -900,
			"y": 1230,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "p_tp",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Test point\nTP1 +12V · TP2 +5V · TP3 +3V3 · TP4 GND\n(มุมล่างซ้ายของบอร์ด)",
			"x": -480,
			"y": 1000,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "mcu",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## U2 ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 N16R8\n(Clone 2022-V1.3 บน Female header 2×22)\n\n| ขา | ชื่อ | Net | ไปที่ |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 3V3 | `+3V3` | ราง +3V3 |\n| 2 | 3V3 | `+3V3` | ราง +3V3 |\n| 3 | EN | `unconnected-(U2-EN-Pad3)` |  |\n| 4 | IO4 | `LIGHT_PWM` | R1.1, R2.1 |\n| 5 | IO5 | `PUMP_A` | R3.1, R4.1 |\n| 6 | IO6 | `PUMP_B` | R5.1, R6.1 |\n| 7 | IO7 | `FLOW` | C4.1, R18.2, R19.2 |\n| 8 | IO15 | `UART2_TX` | J14.2 |\n| 9 | IO16 | `UART2_RX` | R16.2, R17.1 |\n| 10 | IO17 | `UART1_TX` | J13.3 |\n| 11 | IO18 | `UART1_RX` | J13.2 |\n| 12 | IO8 | `I2C_SDA` | J16.3, J17.3, R20.2 |\n| 13 | IO3 | `unconnected-(U2-IO3-Pad13)` |  |\n| 14 | IO46 | `unconnected-(U2-IO46-Pad14)` |  |\n| 15 | IO9 | `I2C_SCL` | J16.4, J17.4, R21.2 |\n| 16 | IO10 | `W5500_CS` | J12.6 |\n| 17 | IO11 | `W5500_MOSI` | J12.4 |\n| 18 | IO12 | `W5500_SCLK` | J12.5 |\n| 19 | IO13 | `W5500_MISO` | J12.3 |\n| 20 | IO14 | `SPARE_IO14` | J11.3 |\n| 21 | 5V | `+5V_DEVKIT` | D1.1 |\n| 22 | GND | `GND` | ราง GND |\n| 23 | GND | `GND` | ราง GND |\n| 24 | TX/IO43 | `unconnected-(U2-TX{slash}IO43-Pad24)` |  |\n| 25 | RX/IO44 | `unconnected-(U2-RX{slash}IO44-Pad25)` |  |\n| 26 | IO1 | `PH_DOWN` | R7.1, R8.1 |\n| 27 | IO2 | `REFILL` | R10.1, R9.1 |\n| 28 | IO42 | `FAN_PWM` | J10.1, R15.1 |\n| 29 | IO41 | `RLY3_AIR` | J9.4, R13.1 |\n| 30 | IO40 | `RLY2_GREEN` | J9.3, R12.1 |\n| 31 | IO39 | `RLY1_RED` | J9.2, R11.1 |\n| 32 | IO38 | `unconnected-(U2-IO38-Pad32)` |  |\n| 33 | IO37 | `unconnected-(U2-IO37-Pad33)` |  |\n| 34 | IO36 | `unconnected-(U2-IO36-Pad34)` |  |\n| 35 | IO35 | `unconnected-(U2-IO35-Pad35)` |  |\n| 36 | IO0 | `unconnected-(U2-IO0-Pad36)` |  |\n| 37 | IO45 | `unconnected-(U2-IO45-Pad37)` |  |\n| 38 | IO48 | `unconnected-(U2-IO48-Pad38)` |  |\n| 39 | IO47 | `SPARE_IO47` | J11.4 |\n| 40 | IO21 | `RLY4_HUM` | J9.5, R14.1 |\n| 41 | IO20 | `unconnected-(U2-IO20-Pad41)` |  |\n| 42 | IO19 | `unconnected-(U2-IO19-Pad42)` |  |\n| 43 | GND | `GND` | ราง GND |\n| 44 | GND | `GND` | ราง GND |\n\n**ไม่ใช้ (NC):** EN, IO0, IO3, IO45, IO46 (Strapping), IO19/20 (USB), IO35–37 (PSRAM), IO38/48 (RGB), TX/RX IO43/44 (UART0 Log)",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 760,
			"height": 1460,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "g_rly",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "RELAY 4CH / พัดลม / Spare",
			"x": 900,
			"y": -1250,
			"width": 1500,
			"height": 820,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "rly",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### J9 RELAY 4CH (XH 6 ขา → Header ของโมดูล Relay)\n| ขา | Net | ต่อกับ |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `GND` | GND |\n| 2 | `RLY1_RED` | IN1 → Ch1 Lamp RED (Pull-down R11 10k) — **GPIO39** |\n| 3 | `RLY2_GREEN` | IN2 → Ch2 Lamp GREEN (Pull-down R12) — **GPIO40** |\n| 4 | `RLY3_AIR` | IN3 → Ch3 Air Pump M105 **ขา NC** (R13) — **GPIO41** |\n| 5 | `RLY4_HUM` | IN4 → Ch4 Humidifier M101 ขา NO (R14) — **GPIO21** |\n| 6 | `RELAY_VCC` | VCC ของโมดูล (เลือกด้วย JP1) |",
			"x": 920,
			"y": -1210,
			"width": 620,
			"height": 330,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "jp1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### JP1 Solder jumper\nRELAY VCC 1-2=5V 2-3=3V3\n1 = +5V · 2 = `RELAY_VCC` · 3 = +3V3\n**ค่าเริ่ม: บัดกรี 1-2 (5V)**",
			"x": 920,
			"y": -850,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "rly_dev",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### โมดูล Relay 4CH (นอกบอร์ด, Active-HIGH / Jumper H)\n| Ch | หน้าสัมผัส | โหลด |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | NO | Lamp RED |\n| 2 | NO | Lamp GREEN |\n| 3 | **NC** | Air Pump 220V (ไม่มีไฟ = ทำงาน) |\n| 4 | NO | Humidifier 5V (USB) |\n\n⚠ 220V อยู่ที่โมดูล Relay เท่านั้น ไม่ผ่าน PCB",
			"x": 1600,
			"y": -1210,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 330,
			"color": "6"
		},
