		{
			"id": "pzem",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### J14 PZEM-004T (XH 4)\n| ขา | Net | ต่อกับ |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `+5V` | 5V |\n| 2 | `UART2_TX` | RX ของ PZEM ← ESP TX — **GPIO15** |\n| 3 | `PZEM_TX_5V` | TX ของ PZEM (5V) |\n| 4 | `GND` | GND |\n\nTX 5V → R16 2.2k → `UART2_RX` → R17 3.3k ลง GND ≈ 3.0V",
			"x": 920,
			"y": 350,
			"width": 640,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "pzem_i0",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "image/PZEM-004T-100A-D-P AC.png",
			"x": 1600,
			"y": 360,
