		},
		{
			"id": "flow",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### J15 YF-S401 Flow (XH 3)\n| ขา | Net | ต่อกับ |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `+5V` | 5V (แดง) |\n| 2 | `GND` | GND (ดำ) |\n| 3 | `FLOW_SIG` | PULSE Open-drain (เหลือง) |\n\n`FLOW_SIG` → R18 1k → `FLOW` + R19 10k Pull-up 3V3 + C4 1nF",
			"x": 920,
			"y": 680,
			"width": 640,
			"height": 280,
			"color": "5"
		},
