			"text": "### J16 SHT40 (XH 4)\n| ขา | Net | ต่อกับ |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `GND` | GND |\n| 2 | `+3V3` | 3V3 |\n| 3 | `I2C_SDA` | SDA — **GPIO8** |\n| 4 | `I2C_SCL` | SCL — **GPIO9** |",
