		},
		{
			"id": "ch0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Grow Light COB 50W — D200 (PWM)\n**GPIO4** `LIGHT_PWM`\n\n1. R1 100R: `LIGHT_PWM` → `LIGHT_G` (Gate)\n2. R2 10k: `LIGHT_PWM` → GND (Pull-down ตอน Boot)\n3. Q1 RD3G500GNTL: G=`LIGHT_G` · D=`LIGHT_D` · S=`GND`\n\n**J4** ขา 1 = `+12V_LED` (+ โหลด) · ขา 2 = `LIGHT_D` (− โหลด)",
			"x": 20,
			"y": 1640,
			"width": 455,
			"height": 400,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "ch0_img",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "image/50W LED Light Grow 12VDC.png",
			"x": 160,
			"y": 2080,
			"width": 175,
			"height": 130
		},
		{
			"id": "ch1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### ปั๊มปุ๋ย A — M103\n**GPIO5** `PUMP_A`\n\n1. R3 100R: `PUMP_A` → `PUMPA_G` (Gate)\n2. R4 10k: `PUMP_A` → GND (Pull-down ตอน Boot)\n3. Q2 RD3G500GNTL: G=`PUMPA_G` · D=`PUMPA_D` · S=`GND`\n4. D2 SK34SMA-3G Flyback: A=`PUMPA_D` · K=`+12V`\n\n**J5** ขา 1 = `+12V` (+ โหลด) · ขา 2 = `PUMPA_D` (− โหลด)",
			"x": 495,
			"y": 1640,
			"width": 455,
			"height": 400,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "ch1_img",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "image/Peristaltic pump.png",
			"x": 635,
			"y": 2080,
			"width": 175,
			"height": 130
		},
		{
			"id": "ch2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### ปั๊มปุ๋ย B — M104\n**GPIO6** `PUMP_B`\n\n1. R5 100R: `PUMP_B` → `PUMPB_G` (Gate)\n2. R6 10k: `PUMP_B` → GND (Pull-down ตอน Boot)\n3. Q3 RD3G500GNTL: G=`PUMPB_G` · D=`PUMPB_D` · S=`GND`\n4. D3 SK34SMA-3G Flyback: A=`PUMPB_D` · K=`+12V`\n\n**J6** ขา 1 = `+12V` (+ โหลด) · ขา 2 = `PUMPB_D` (− โหลด)",
			"x": 970,
			"y": 1640,
			"width": 455,
			"height": 400,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "ch2_img",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "image/Peristaltic pump.png",
			"x": 1110,
			"y": 2080,
			"width": 175,
			"height": 130
		},
		{
			"id": "ch3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### ปั๊ม pH Down — M106\n**GPIO1** `PH_DOWN`\n\n1. R7 100R: `PH_DOWN` → `PHDOWN_G` (Gate)\n2. R8 10k: `PH_DOWN` → GND (Pull-down ตอน Boot)\n3. Q4 RD3G500GNTL: G=`PHDOWN_G` · D=`PHDOWN_D` · S=`GND`\n4. D4 SK34SMA-3G Flyback: A=`PHDOWN_D` · K=`+12V`\n\n**J7** ขา 1 = `+12V` (+ โหลด) · ขา 2 = `PHDOWN_D` (− โหลด)",
			"x": 1445,
			"y": 1640,
			"width": 455,
			"height": 400,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "ch3_img",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "image/Peristaltic pump.png",
			"x": 1585,
			"y": 2080,
			"width": 175,
			"height": 130
		},
		{
			"id": "ch4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### ปั๊มเติมน้ำ — M102\n**GPIO2** `REFILL`\n\n1. R9 100R: `REFILL` → `REFILL_G` (Gate)\n2. R10 10k: `REFILL` → GND (Pull-down ตอน Boot)\n3. Q5 RD3G500GNTL: G=`REFILL_G` · D=`REFILL_D` · S=`GND`\n4. D5 SK34SMA-3G Flyback: A=`REFILL_D` · K=`+12V`\n\n**J8** ขา 1 = `+12V` (+ โหลด) · ขา 2 = `REFILL_D` (− โหลด)",
			"x": 1920,
			"y": 1640,
			"width": 455,
			"height": 400,
			"color": "4"
		},
